				<!--<dl>
					<dt>수정일</dt>
					<dd>2025.11.11</dd>
				</dl>-->
				<dl>
					<dt>조회수 : </dt>
					<dd>726</dd>
				</dl>
				
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="artclShare">
			<div class="left">
				
			</div>
			<div class="right">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	
	<div class="artclView">
		
				<h2 class="artclViewTitle" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: NotoKR; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 1.3em; background-image: none; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; text-align: center;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16pt;">2026학년도 전기 대학원(</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16pt;">일반&middot;교육&middot;산업) 신입생 모집 안내</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">1. 모집과정&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">　가. 일반대학원 박사학위과정 (일반전형)</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">　나.&nbsp;교육대학원&nbsp;석사학위과정 (일반전형)</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">　다.</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;산업</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">대</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">학</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">원</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;석</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">사학위과정&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">(일반전형)</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">2. 모집인원: 각 전공별 약간명</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">3. 전형일정</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 원서접수 : 2025.11.24.(월)~ 11.28.(금) 18:00, 인터넷 원서 접수 및 제출서류 직접 또는 방문 제출(원서접수 마감기한 전 도착한 서류에 한함)</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 면접고사 : 2025.12.6.(토) 10:00</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 합격자발표:&nbsp;<span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">2025.12.24.(수)</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; -&nbsp;입학예치금납부 :&nbsp;2025.12.29.(월)~12.30.(화) 16:00[은행업무시간 내]</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 등록금납부(일반전형) :&nbsp;2026.2.4.(수)~2.6.(금) 16:00[은행업무시간 내]</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 입학(개강)일 : 2026.3.1.(일)</p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">4. 대학원별 입학안내 홈페이지 바로가기</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">　가. 일반대학원 :&nbsp;<a href="/grad" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">https://www.seowon.ac.kr/grad</a></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">　나.&nbsp;교육대학원 :&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="/graduate/index.do" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">https://www.seowon.ac.kr/graduate/index.do</a></span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">　다.</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;산업</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">대</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">학</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">원 :&nbsp;<a href="/industry" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">https://www.seowon.ac.kr/industry</a></span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"></span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13.3333px;"></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">5. 문의처: 서원대학교 대학원 교학팀(043-299-8254)</span></p>
<p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp; - 세부사항&nbsp;및 입학원서 첨부파일&nbsp;참조 요망</p></h2>
			
